00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This video will introduce you to the main function of Kolo 2025.1, the seamless division.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:11,000
In the past, if there was a flat color design on the fabric, it was necessary to cut and sew the sheets and then set them separately.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Now with the seamless division function, you do not need to cut the sheets again.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
It is possible to separate each area, and thus apply color or texture like processing a separate fabric.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This is especially convenient for the design of a combination of various colors or textures such as needles or applications of different materials.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
First of all, we will demonstrate how to create a seamless division line through an example file.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The seamless division is located under the multi-edged tool in the 2D tool bar.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
After selecting the tool, you can draw a seamless division line by pressing the outside line of the board.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Please note that you cannot start drawing from the inside of the board.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
The seamless division line can be created in the same way as the inner line.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
By pressing multiple points to create any shape you want.

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
When drawing a straight line, press the Shift key to create a 45-degree support line.

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
To help you accurately draw a vertical line and a horizontal line,

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
or a 45-degree support line,

15
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
